              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amathambo kaJosefa abakoIsrayeli abaphuma lawo eGibithe angcwatshelwa eShekema, esiqintini uJakobe asithenga kubantwana bakaHamori uyise kaShekema ngenhlamvu zemali ezilikhulu; saba yilifa labantwana bakaJosefa.",
          "type": "text",
